    kind: work_item  # 21aa
    title: "A launch that returns a HANDLE leaves its crossing unrepresented in 4 languages (Popen.stdout, Process.getInputStream, Cmd.StdoutPipe, popen FILE*) where rust already rows the far end"  # 21aa
    status: todo_hard  # 21aa
    priority: 2  # 21aa
